WEBVTT

00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:05.580
So this is the power the gods seek.

00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:07.160
You have to save Mugaro!

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:09.950
You have to save the demons!

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:14.130
It's not working! I can't transform!

00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:18.050
Imprison both in the prison tower,
where they will be held indefinitely.

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:22.840
Everyone says you're a great king
who made the capital rich,

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:24.220
but it's all a lie!

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:26.760
You're just an evil king!

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:31.390
Well, well. If it isn't the great and noble knight,
gracing us with his presence.

00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:34.400
Yo.

00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:49.790
How are you, Mom?

00:00:49.950 --> 00:00:54.580
I'm living with many friends now.

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:55.960
Just like at the capital,

00:00:56.130 --> 00:01:00.130
I've found work that is perfect for a girl like me.

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:01.760
What are you doing?

00:01:03.050 --> 00:01:04.800
Are you okay?

00:01:05.470 --> 00:01:07.640
You, stay out of this.

00:01:16.190 --> 00:01:17.900
This place is full of women.

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:20.650
It's like our own little village.

00:01:24.320 --> 00:01:25.610
Start eating.

00:01:26.530 --> 00:01:29.450
If I had to complain about something...

00:01:29.620 --> 00:01:30.620
Seconds.

00:01:32.580 --> 00:01:34.370
There isn't much to eat.

00:01:37.290 --> 00:01:39.920
And I don't get to see the sun.

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:43.840
But I shouldn't act so spoiled.

00:01:44.010 --> 00:01:48.090
Because I was given a special room
that's better than anyone else's.

00:01:48.260 --> 00:01:50.140
So I'm thankful for that.

00:01:56.940 --> 00:01:59.110
It's been ten days already.

00:02:00.940 --> 00:02:04.150
Today's my birthday.

00:02:07.240 --> 00:02:11.450
Happy birthday to me...

00:02:11.620 --> 00:02:13.410
Nina, age 17.

00:02:13.580 --> 00:02:16.120
I'm doing fine as always.

00:02:39.230 --> 00:02:43.360
Rage of Bahamut

00:04:09.150 --> 00:04:12.450
Favaro, what are you doing here?

00:04:13.950 --> 00:04:15.700
A lot happened.

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:18.740
What about you?
What did you do to end up here?

00:04:18.910 --> 00:04:20.750
Touch a woman's butt?

00:04:20.910 --> 00:04:22.420
This is not a joke.

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:29.960
I have not committed any crimes.

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:33.720
I only tried to stop Azazel's revolt.

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:35.340
Azazel did what?

00:04:35.510 --> 00:04:36.850
Be quiet.

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:39.270
Is he in the capital?

00:04:39.430 --> 00:04:40.730
He hid in the capital,

00:04:40.890 --> 00:04:45.610
and murdered anybody
who treated demons inhumanely.

00:04:46.060 --> 00:04:51.440
So they must have thrown you in here
because they thought you were with Azazel.

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:55.360
You're just as ham-fisted as ever.

00:04:55.530 --> 00:04:56.740
Azazel...

00:04:57.450 --> 00:05:02.210
Why does he continue to act so recklessly?

00:05:02.370 --> 00:05:04.790
Even involving a young girl.

00:05:04.960 --> 00:05:06.170
Girl?

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:07.670
Yes.

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:10.550
A girl named Nina who
wears clothes from a foreign land.

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:13.930
She was brought here to this prison with me.

00:05:14.090 --> 00:05:17.260
Nina? Nina...

00:05:17.430 --> 00:05:20.100
You mean that little shrimp Nina?

00:05:20.260 --> 00:05:22.060
You know her?

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:24.100
Well, you know...

00:05:24.270 --> 00:05:27.060
There's not a woman I don't know!

00:05:48.130 --> 00:05:49.590
Drink up, drink up.

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:50.750
Drink up all you want.

00:05:50.920 --> 00:05:52.510
Oh, thank you.

00:05:52.670 --> 00:05:53.670
It's nothing.

00:05:53.840 --> 00:05:58.140
It's my policy to spend the bounty reward
before the day is out.

00:05:58.300 --> 00:06:00.430
How generous. And you're so young.

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:02.600
He's not that young.

00:06:02.770 --> 00:06:08.190
Well, all the men leave the village for work,
so even he feels young.

00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:12.690
Honestly, I've never seen hair like this before.

00:06:12.860 --> 00:06:15.440
So, you mentioned a bounty reward, which means—

00:06:15.610 --> 00:06:17.530
Yeah, I'm a bounty hunter.

00:06:17.700 --> 00:06:20.240
Favaro Leone, the bounty hunter.

00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:23.240
Never heard of you.

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:24.580
That's weird.

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:28.540
I mean, this was my 300th bounty
I've collected.

00:06:28.710 --> 00:06:30.920
Three hundred? Oh my.

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:34.670
I'm having real trouble
spending all the money I've earned.

00:06:34.840 --> 00:06:36.920
Who have you taken down so far?

00:06:37.090 --> 00:06:40.220
Real villains who would break the heart
of a good woman like you.

00:06:40.390 --> 00:06:42.180
Yeah, right.

00:06:42.350 --> 00:06:44.970
What kind of cities have you been to?

00:06:45.140 --> 00:06:49.270
Many with good women like you.

00:06:49.810 --> 00:06:53.520
Oh, you're so full of it.

00:06:58.490 --> 00:07:00.110
Why are you so strong?

00:07:00.280 --> 00:07:03.450
Well, we're dragonfolk, after all.

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:47.290
What the hell?

00:07:54.880 --> 00:07:56.460
Please make me your apprentice.

00:08:01.130 --> 00:08:03.550
I want to earn money.

00:08:03.720 --> 00:08:06.010
You can't earn anything as a bounty hunter.

00:08:06.180 --> 00:08:07.180
Liar.

00:08:07.350 --> 00:08:09.770
There aren't as many outlaws as there used to be.

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:12.940
You said you couldn't
spend all the money you've earned.

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:15.110
Did I say that?

00:08:15.270 --> 00:08:18.650
You did. Please make me your apprentice.

00:08:18.820 --> 00:08:22.700
Give it up. A little shrimp like you isn't cut out for it.

00:08:23.410 --> 00:08:27.790
Bounty hunters need to be strong
but also quick.

00:08:28.370 --> 00:08:31.080
I am, you know. I'm pretty strong.

00:08:44.970 --> 00:08:47.390
Please make me your apprentice.

00:08:51.680 --> 00:08:52.890
Seriously?

00:08:53.810 --> 00:08:55.940
Please make me your apprentice.

00:09:01.280 --> 00:09:03.530
Nope. I can't handle this freak show.

00:09:12.620 --> 00:09:14.710
Please, make me your apprentice.

00:09:14.870 --> 00:09:16.460
So you're dragonfolk.

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:19.500
My mother is human.

00:09:19.670 --> 00:09:21.260
My father is a dragon though.

00:09:21.420 --> 00:09:22.510
So you're half dragon?

00:09:23.010 --> 00:09:25.720
But I'm very strong and fast, right?

00:09:38.230 --> 00:09:39.570
Guess I don't have a choice.

00:09:39.730 --> 00:09:41.690
Just while I'm here in the village.

00:09:42.320 --> 00:09:45.030
But in exchange, I'll need a room
and three meals a day.

00:09:47.410 --> 00:09:49.780
Yay!

00:10:28.780 --> 00:10:32.080
What a mess I've gotten myself into.

00:10:34.330 --> 00:10:38.120
At least the hot springs are as relaxing as they say.

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:41.130
It was worth coming all the way out here.

00:10:57.810 --> 00:10:59.940
That feels so good.

00:11:04.280 --> 00:11:07.150
You're a bold one, aren't you?

00:11:44.110 --> 00:11:46.900
Transforming into a dragon
when you see a handsome guy?

00:11:47.070 --> 00:11:49.740
That's some tricky stuff you have to deal with.

00:11:49.900 --> 00:11:52.530
So how come you only transformed then?

00:11:52.700 --> 00:11:56.080
I'm not exactly sure, but maybe it was
because you didn't have an afro.

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:58.910
What? Is this not cool?

00:11:59.080 --> 00:12:02.120
Anyway, please, let's get to today's lesson.

00:12:03.790 --> 00:12:05.250
Today's our last lesson.

00:12:05.420 --> 00:12:07.000
What? Already?

00:12:07.170 --> 00:12:08.880
Listen carefully, Nina.

00:12:09.050 --> 00:12:13.510
Quickly forgetting about the bounty you've caught
is the secret to being a good bounty hunter.

00:12:13.680 --> 00:12:15.260
Why is that?

00:12:15.430 --> 00:12:17.510
If we forget about it,

00:12:17.680 --> 00:12:19.730
then they won't harbor resentments either.

00:12:20.810 --> 00:12:23.350
Wow, that's so deep, Master.

00:12:23.520 --> 00:12:24.520
So, what else?

00:12:24.690 --> 00:12:25.940
That's all.

00:12:26.110 --> 00:12:28.400
I've got nothing left to teach you now.

00:12:28.570 --> 00:12:29.610
Hold out your arm.

00:12:31.650 --> 00:12:34.110
This is the mark of a bounty hunter.

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:37.790
We match.

00:12:37.950 --> 00:12:39.910
Thank you very much.

00:12:40.870 --> 00:12:44.170
I guess now this makes me a bounty hunter too.

00:12:44.330 --> 00:12:47.250
All right. I'm gonna do a great job.

00:12:47.420 --> 00:12:50.760
-Master, are you going on foot?
-Yeah.

00:12:50.920 --> 00:12:52.760
Take care!

00:12:52.930 --> 00:12:56.550
I probably won't forget about you!

00:12:56.720 --> 00:12:58.220
Probably?

00:12:58.390 --> 00:13:00.020
Oh, that's right.

00:13:00.180 --> 00:13:02.980
Go to Anatae if you want work.

00:13:03.140 --> 00:13:06.690
Once you get to the capital, go visit
the funny colored carriage.

00:13:06.860 --> 00:13:11.150
The duck and drunk that live there
are in charge of the bounty hunters.

00:13:11.320 --> 00:13:12.400
Okay.

00:13:13.150 --> 00:13:16.120
Nina, which way does the wind blow?

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:23.870
-This way.
-No, no.

00:13:24.330 --> 00:13:25.620
It blows to tomorrow.

00:13:29.340 --> 00:13:33.130
I don't really get it, but to tomorrow!

00:13:33.300 --> 00:13:37.090
Rage of Bahamut

00:13:39.180 --> 00:13:42.310
I had no idea that girl was the red dragon.

00:13:44.020 --> 00:13:45.270
I see.

00:13:45.440 --> 00:13:47.310
Azazel used the girl to...

00:13:47.480 --> 00:13:49.190
Way too reckless.

00:13:49.360 --> 00:13:52.780
So, what did you do to get put in here?

00:13:52.940 --> 00:13:56.410
At the town I visited after the dragon village...

00:13:56.570 --> 00:14:00.450
I suddenly got surrounded
by about 100 royal soldiers.

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:03.950
I gave them a fight though.

00:14:21.390 --> 00:14:23.720
What the hell is going on!

00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:27.850
They took something precious from me.

00:14:28.520 --> 00:14:31.610
I was subjected to one horrifying thing
after another.

00:14:32.480 --> 00:14:35.820
I have to think the king was just toying with me.

00:14:35.990 --> 00:14:37.610
By King Charioce?

00:14:37.780 --> 00:14:42.030
I've just been held here ever since.

00:14:43.700 --> 00:14:44.870
Favaro...

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:47.040
Were the soldiers who arrested you

00:14:47.210 --> 00:14:49.080
wearing onyx black armor?

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:52.420
Yeah, they were real creepy guys.

00:14:52.590 --> 00:14:55.420
Wait, weren't you a captain?

00:14:55.590 --> 00:14:57.590
Are your knights gonna be okay

00:14:57.760 --> 00:15:00.220
after their captain got arrested?

00:15:02.600 --> 00:15:03.850
Yes.

00:15:04.010 --> 00:15:08.560
I hope I haven't made them too miserable.

00:15:22.780 --> 00:15:25.290
Wow, you're such a beast.

00:15:25.450 --> 00:15:27.830
So cute! He's blushing.

00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:32.250
-You must look great under that shirt.
-You can show us tonight.

00:15:32.420 --> 00:15:34.880
Alessand, we should leave soon.

00:15:36.340 --> 00:15:39.470
-Where did Lady Jeanne go?
-Who's that?

00:15:39.630 --> 00:15:42.510
Lady Jeanne D'Arc. My dream woman.

00:15:42.680 --> 00:15:47.980
I only joined the Orleans Knights
because Lady Jeanne was leading them.

00:15:48.140 --> 00:15:49.980
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:15:50.140 --> 00:15:54.610
It's Cerberus, the best guardian
to the gates of Hell.

00:15:55.400 --> 00:15:56.400
Cerby.

00:15:56.570 --> 00:16:00.110
What's wrong, Al? You look all sad.

00:16:00.280 --> 00:16:03.870
Cerby, you think I can
become a great knight one day?

00:16:04.030 --> 00:16:05.700
I don't see why not.

00:16:05.870 --> 00:16:06.870
Yeah.

00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:08.410
Really?

00:16:08.580 --> 00:16:10.750
No, there's no way.

00:16:10.910 --> 00:16:13.130
The Orleans Knights are done for.

00:16:13.290 --> 00:16:15.380
The captain got arrested.

00:16:15.540 --> 00:16:19.340
Oh, he got arrested?

00:16:19.510 --> 00:16:21.220
Oh, in that case...

00:16:21.380 --> 00:16:23.640
Why don't you become the new captain, Al?

00:16:23.800 --> 00:16:25.640
What? Me, the captain?

00:16:25.800 --> 00:16:27.890
Yeah. You're the captain now.

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:29.730
You're the captain now.

00:16:29.890 --> 00:16:32.140
-I'm the captain?
-You're the captain.

00:16:32.310 --> 00:16:34.310
-I'm the captain?
-You're the captain.

00:16:34.480 --> 00:16:35.900
I'm the captain.

00:16:36.060 --> 00:16:38.150
Yeah! Let's hear it for Al!

00:16:38.320 --> 00:16:41.400
-I'm Alessand, captain of the Orleans Knights.
-You're the captain.

00:16:46.370 --> 00:16:48.540
-Do you want to eat this?
-Are you sure?

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:50.450
I have a small appetite.

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:51.660
I insist.

00:16:51.830 --> 00:16:54.120
Thank you very much.

00:17:00.590 --> 00:17:02.130
I'm Nina.

00:17:02.300 --> 00:17:04.590
I am Jeanne D'Arc.

00:17:05.180 --> 00:17:07.720
You're a good person, Ms. D'Arc.

00:17:08.930 --> 00:17:10.270
Jeanne is fine.

00:17:10.430 --> 00:17:12.390
Okay, Ms. Jeanne.

00:17:18.070 --> 00:17:20.610
Why were you brought to this prison?

00:17:20.780 --> 00:17:23.200
You do not look like you would commit a crime.

00:17:23.360 --> 00:17:26.070
You don't either.

00:17:32.580 --> 00:17:37.580
Because of me, my friend
and an acquaintance were taken away.

00:17:41.130 --> 00:17:44.590
I wasn't able to save them,
because I'm not experienced enough.

00:17:45.880 --> 00:17:47.260
I see.

00:17:47.430 --> 00:17:50.260
I am sorry for bringing up a painful experience.

00:17:50.430 --> 00:17:51.850
And after that,

00:17:52.020 --> 00:17:55.190
they mistakenly thought I was working
with a demon named Azazel.

00:17:55.350 --> 00:18:00.190
So I was thrown in here with a captain,
one with funny hair.

00:18:00.820 --> 00:18:02.610
What's wrong, Jeanne?

00:18:02.780 --> 00:18:03.900
Captain?

00:18:04.070 --> 00:18:06.660
You do not mean Kaisar, do you?

00:18:08.070 --> 00:18:10.530
I think that was his name.

00:18:15.910 --> 00:18:17.210
I see.

00:18:17.370 --> 00:18:19.880
You already knew everyone.

00:18:20.460 --> 00:18:22.920
Although I have not seen them in years.

00:18:23.090 --> 00:18:24.590
Then what about Mugaro?

00:18:25.550 --> 00:18:29.300
She's a quiet girl with a mysterious power.

00:18:29.470 --> 00:18:31.350
When her left eye glows,

00:18:31.510 --> 00:18:33.100
everything's like:

00:18:35.230 --> 00:18:37.980
Apparently Azazel saved her from a slave trader.

00:18:39.020 --> 00:18:41.770
But when we were arrested,

00:18:41.940 --> 00:18:45.490
Mugaro was taken up into the sky
by glowing people.

00:18:45.650 --> 00:18:48.530
Was the child not a boy?

00:18:48.700 --> 00:18:50.530
No, she is a girl.

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:52.740
She was a girl, right?

00:18:53.990 --> 00:18:57.960
Could you tell me more about this child?

00:19:03.420 --> 00:19:06.260
The child still will not open up to us.

00:19:06.420 --> 00:19:10.890
It is likely he spent too much time in the lower world.

00:19:11.050 --> 00:19:12.850
If you would allow me more time...

00:19:13.010 --> 00:19:15.350
There is no time we can spare.

00:19:15.520 --> 00:19:18.230
I will awaken the child into godhood.

00:19:18.390 --> 00:19:20.100
Do you not think it is too soon?

00:19:20.270 --> 00:19:22.480
Regaining his true form...

00:19:22.650 --> 00:19:25.820
That is something El should want as well.

00:19:27.990 --> 00:19:30.950
Prepare the ritual at once.

00:19:51.640 --> 00:19:55.310
El, do you not remember me?

00:19:55.470 --> 00:19:58.640
I must apologize to you.

00:19:58.810 --> 00:20:03.650
It is my fault that you were separated
from your mother.

00:20:04.650 --> 00:20:10.570
I was once saved by your mother and your power.

00:20:10.740 --> 00:20:12.610
Now it is my turn.

00:20:12.780 --> 00:20:15.410
I will save your mother, no matter the cost.

00:20:22.920 --> 00:20:26.460
I ask that you do not forget that.

00:20:40.600 --> 00:20:41.600
Here.

00:20:41.770 --> 00:20:43.020
Thank you.

00:20:45.270 --> 00:20:46.770
Nina.

00:20:46.940 --> 00:20:48.440
Who said that?

00:20:48.610 --> 00:20:50.990
Oh, what is it, Jeanne?

00:20:52.860 --> 00:20:54.910
Pretend to work as you listen.

00:20:55.530 --> 00:20:57.370
I am going to leave this place.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:01.960
Can you really do that?

00:21:02.120 --> 00:21:03.420
I do not know.

00:21:04.290 --> 00:21:07.460
But I wish to leave here and meet this child, Mugaro.

00:21:07.630 --> 00:21:09.800
You want to meet Mugaro?

00:21:10.630 --> 00:21:13.340
I need to meet Mugaro and see something for myself.

00:21:13.510 --> 00:21:16.550
So please help me.

00:21:24.310 --> 00:21:28.320
Okay. Let's get out of here
and go see Mugaro together.

00:22:02.140 --> 00:22:05.980
It's okay, it's okay
I cast the usual spell

00:22:06.140 --> 00:22:10.190
Stagnation, stagnation
My words and heart are at odds

00:22:10.360 --> 00:22:14.070
Default
I've taken all the paint

00:22:14.240 --> 00:22:18.870
And mixed up all the colors
Until you're left with me

00:22:19.030 --> 00:22:20.870
So fragile
Yet strong

00:22:21.030 --> 00:22:22.990
Close to overflowing
But not spilling

00:22:23.160 --> 00:22:27.000
Because I'm incomplete
I won't amount to much

00:22:27.170 --> 00:22:31.250
This is just a good-luck charm
I'm not asking for your help

00:22:31.420 --> 00:22:35.380
This is just a good-luck charm
I was just clinging to you

00:22:35.550 --> 00:22:39.640
Let's end it all today

00:22:39.800 --> 00:22:43.930
I'm done living this pointless life

00:22:44.100 --> 00:22:47.940
Let's end it all today

00:22:48.100 --> 00:22:52.480
I've taken my last pointless breath

00:22:53.610 --> 00:22:57.650
To whom it may concern
See you and goodbye

00:22:57.820 --> 00:23:01.830
I killed the person I was yesterday

00:23:01.990 --> 00:23:06.450
To whom it may concern
See you and goodbye

00:23:06.620 --> 00:23:13.420
A new morning is coming

00:23:26.850 --> 00:23:29.520
Okay, Hippogriff, I'll see you later.

00:23:35.860 --> 00:23:39.450
These guys are such a handful.

00:23:46.750 --> 00:23:48.620
-Ro-sham.
-Rock.

00:23:48.790 --> 00:23:49.870
Hey.

00:23:50.040 --> 00:23:52.460
-Rock.
-Rock, paper.

00:23:52.630 --> 00:23:53.750
Ro-sham.

00:23:53.920 --> 00:23:57.380
Next time on Rage of Bahamut: Virgin Soul,
"The Way She Was."

